Package: panebox
Version: PLACEHOLDER_VERSION
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: PaneBox Linux port <panebox@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, python3-pil, python3-requests, python3-watchdog, python3-dateutil
Recommends: gir1.2-notify-0.7, pulseaudio-utils, xdg-utils
Description: Floating desktop organizer widgets (Linux port of DeskBox)
 PaneBox pins real-folder-backed file widgets to the desktop layer, plus
 Todo, Quick Capture, Glance (clock/lunar), Weather, Music and Search
 feature widgets — tray control, hotkeys, per-monitor layout memory and
 12-language localization.
